{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EPOS 11</strong> is a first-person, story-driven sci-fi horror game set on a partially evacuated space station deep in orbit. As the player arrives aboard the crumbling EPOS 11 station, they must complete a series of assigned tasks while unraveling the dark secrets of what happened there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay focuses on <strong>atmosphere, exploration, and environmental storytelling</strong>. Players move through abandoned corridors, interact with terminals, collect clues, and piece together the station\u2019s mysterious downfall. Tension builds gradually through visual and audio cues\u2014no sudden jump scares, but a persistent sense of dread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-person immersive gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A branching storyline with <strong>multiple outcomes</strong> based on player decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles and task-based progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic visual effects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist, eerie soundtrack enhancing the sense of isolation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime is approximately <strong>1.5\u20132.5 hours</strong>, depending on exploration. The game is ideal for fans of <strong>sci-fi thrillers</strong>, <strong>narrative-heavy experiences</strong>, and slow-burn psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no graphic depictions of violence, but scenes include blood, psychological distress, and disturbing environments.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3867770?t=1770065383","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867770/8f86bc7cca179d4b9a2e1114edf54c88c1b700d0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1770065383","capsule_image":"https://shared.aka