ayer decisions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental puzzles and task-based progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic visual effects </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimalist, eerie soundtrack enhancing the sense of isolation</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playtime is approximately <strong>1.5\u20132.5 hours</strong>, depending on exploration. The game is ideal for fans of <strong>sci-fi thrillers</strong>, <strong>narrative-heavy experiences</strong>, and slow-burn psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no graphic depictions of violence, but scenes include blood, psychological distress, and disturbing environments.</p>","developers":["Bee Lines"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3867770/0dee59932aaa60924f62307ad0b47e4858ea1d2a/header.jpg?t=1770065383","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867770/2026928840/2d6b36b331fcc481a5380c419f67638ebf247448/1765138360/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765139520","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867770/2026928840/2d6b36b331fcc481a5380c419f67638ebf247448/1765138360/dash_h264.mpd?t=1765139520","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867770/2026928840/2d6b36b331fcc481a5380c419f67638ebf247448/1765138360/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1765139520","id":257244900,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257244900/bd7e1ecc0947b2dd29cd6685cf86d2292d3dfdef/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1765139520"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3867770/1040102281/a11a0714421659fdeb0c040d95eb24ce66f18c7c/1765136405/dash_av1.mpd?t=1768506670","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamsta